:1150.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":1490.0,"yMax":240.0},"title":"Worker","body":"Die, fight back while there is a target, then the player''s orders by priority, then idle. Orders are numbered per channel: a build order writes site and buildOrder, a gather order writes resource and gatherOrder, a move order writes destination and orderNumber, and each branch completes its own number. FightBack is Combat''s Engage with Fists; when the target dies the order facts are untouched, so the interrupted job re-enters with the same arguments.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"3c938631-bb9c-4a22-a8af-466b9e3d9b9c","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"$ref":"51"},{"VariableKind":"Object","NodeComment":null,"relations":{"$content":[],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ConnectionCollection`3[[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPortRelation, ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null],[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPort, ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null],[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPort, ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null]]"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"defaultValues":{"Key":{"$content":"resource","$type":"System.String"}},"LastExecutionStatus":"None","runtimeException":null,"positionRect":{"xMin":5304.0,"yMin":1356.0,"xMax":5454.0,"yMax":1444.0},"guid":"7ac9c4be-b7ef-40b6-b584-6e828cf2178c","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.GetVariable","$id":"62"},{"$ref":"38"},{"ScriptGraphVariable":{"returnType":"System.Object, mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089","function":6,"$id":"66"},"parameters":[{"Name":"issued","Type":"System.Int32","Optional":false,"DefaultValue":null},{"Name":"known","Type":"System.Int32","Optional":false,"DefaultValue":null}],"resultType":"System.Boolean","scriptGraphVariables":[{"$ref":"66"}],"comment":"HasNewOrder","relations":{"$content":[],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ConnectionCollection`3[[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPort